==========================================================================
  PDG 2024 (D/H fit)         → ω_ring = 72.72 (dev vs 72.59: +0.19%)
  Planck 2018                → ω_ring = 72.70 (dev vs 72.59: +0.15%)
  IDCM 結構目標 (循環警告!)          → ω_ring = 72.47 (dev vs 72.59: -0.16%) ⚠️ 循環
  BBN lower 1σ               → ω_ring = 72.28 (dev vs 72.59: -0.42%)
  BBN upper 1σ               → ω_ring = 73.18 (dev vs 72.59: +0.81%)

